# Android project credentials (Supabase URL/anon key, Google Web Client ID, API base URLs) live
# machine-local in ~/.gradle/gradle.properties or via -P overrides — never in the repo, so a
# `git add -A` can't reach them. The tracked android/gradle.properties holds BUILD CONFIG ONLY
# (android.useAndroidX etc., required for a fresh clone to build) and deliberately has no credentials.

# Supabase CLI local state (project-ref, pooler URL, tool versions) — machine-local, not source.
supabase/.temp/
